<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to auction 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to auction 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said on Friday it would auction 3.0 billion pesos worth of Cetes at the primary auction on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It will also auction 500 million pesos worth of UDI bonds and 900 million pesos worth of two-year Bondes.  </p>
<p>CETES</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>    28  days     800 million pesos  19.01 pct</p>
<p>    91  days     800 million pesos  20.22 pct</p>
<p>    182 days     800 million pesos  19.79 pct</p>
<p>    357 days     600 million pesos  18.64 pct</p>
<p>BONDES</p>
<p>    728 days     900 million pesos  100.0 pct</p>
<p>UDIBONOS</p>
<p>    1,064 days   250 million UDIs   99.9931</p>
<p>    1,792 days   250 million UDIs   99.9931</p>
<p>((--Dan Trotta, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9507))</p>
